一子后，大举进犯，红应付的尚可，但炮五平七随手，对黑攻击手段估计不足，未发现黑车4进7妙手，属致命的失着。红应改走炮五平九（黑如继续走车4进7，则炮九进一），虽仍受攻，但尚无大碍。\n此时形势，黑进车士角，绝妙的楔子打入红的微小缝隙，由此敲开红方城门，展开攻王的战斗。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":28,"anchor_node_id":"0:28","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment30:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment30","raw_text":"红上左士败着，应后炮平三弃炮，以下炮7进2，再士六进五，尚可维持。黑就势杀相是入局妙手，预定的攻王计划。","text":"红上左士败着，应后炮平三弃炮，以下炮7进2，再士六进五，尚可维持。黑就势杀相是入局妙手，预定的攻王计划。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":30,"anchor_node_id":"0:30","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment40:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment40","raw_text":"黑胜。||红如接走炮四平五，则炮7进3，炮五退二，炮7平5，得子胜。","text":"黑胜。\n红如接走炮四平五，则炮7进3，炮五退二，炮7平5，得子胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":40,"anchor_node_id":"0:40","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["香港翁德强 先负 石家庄阎文清"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第一章 中炮对屏风马类（56局）"],"DhtmlXQ_place":["山打根"],"DhtmlXQ_result":["黑胜"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["C31 中炮过河车互进七兵对屏风马上士"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":15,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":40,"legal_move_records":40,"annotations":5,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":5}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-66","category_id":"66","title":"第一章 中炮对屏风马类 香港翁德强 先负 石家庄阎文清","catalogue_order":31,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/List-66-2.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-66"]}}
